  "name": "Cobb Salad Pizza",
  "subtitle": "Crisp pizza topped with dressed salad and blue cheese",
  "description": "Bake a simple yeast dough, then finish it with tangy dressing, chopped salad vegetables, cooked chicken, eggs, parsley, and crumbled Stilton.",
